rt": 138448, "end": 144991, "text": "Y dijo Jehová Dios: No es bueno que el hombre esté solo; le haré ayuda adecuada para él.", "words": [[0, 138448], [2, 138554], [7, 138834], [14, 139314], [20, 140145], [23, 140289], [26, 140489], [32, 140789], [36, 141029], [39, 141169], [46, 141389], [51, 141729], [57, 142751], [60, 142911], [65, 143151], [71, 143471], [80, 144111], [85, 144411]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 145271, "end": 160765, "text": "Formó, pues, Jehová Dios de la tierra toda bestia del campo, y toda ave de los cielos, y las trajo a Adam, para que viese cómo les había de llamar; y todo lo que Adam llamó a los animales vivientes, ese es su nombre.", "words": [[0, 145271], [7, 145775], [13, 146635], [20, 147155], [25, 147375], [28, 147595], [31, 147715], [38, 148075], [43, 148335], [50, 148895], [54, 149035], [61, 149635], [63, 150195], [68, 150435], [72, 150835], [75, 150975], [79, 151115], [87, 151447], [89, 151778], [93, 152110], [99, 152550], [101, 152730], [107, 153090], [112, 153750], [116, 153930], [122, 154310], [127, 154590], [131, 154770], [137, 155070], [140, 155270], [148, 155999], [150, 156140], [155, 156360], [158, 156620], [162, 156780], [167, 157140], [173, 157700], [175, 157780], [179, 157920], [188, 158280], [199, 159300], [203, 159620], [206, 159920], [209, 160120]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 161115, "end": 171134, "text": "Y puso Adam nombres a toda bestia y ave de los cielos y a todo animal del campo: mas para Adam no halló ayuda adecuada para él.", "words": [[0, 161115], [2, 161221], [7, 161661], [12, 162121], [20, 162781], [22, 162961], [27, 163121], [34, 163761], [36, 164301], [40, 164441], [43, 164561], [47, 164701], [54, 165401], [56, 165781], [58, 165881], [63, 166041], [70, 166441], [74, 166721], [81, 167716], [85, 167902], [90, 168202], [95, 168724], [98, 168966], [104, 169207], [110, 169607], [119, 170347], [124, 170587]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 171484, "end": 182055, "text": "Y Jehová Dios hizo caer sueño sobre Adam, y se quedó dormido: entonces tomó una de sus costillas, y cerró la carne en su lugar;", "words": [[0, 171484], [2, 171609], [9, 172149], [14, 172469], [19, 173109], [24, 173609], [30, 174089], [36, 174449], [42, 174969], [44, 175549], [47, 175689], [53, 176109], [62, 177026], [71, 177768], [76, 178328], [80, 178628], [83, 178788], [87, 178968], [98, 179628], [100, 180228], [106, 180608], [109, 180748], [115, 181088], [118, 181328], [121, 181468]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 182405, "end": 188480, "text": "Y de la costilla que Jehová Dios tomó del hombre, hizo una mujer, y la trajo al hombre.", "words": [[0, 182405], [2, 182544], [5, 182624], [8, 182744], [17, 183364], [21, 183564], [28, 184044], [33, 184244], [38, 184804], [42, 184944], [50, 185744], [55, 186024], [59, 186324], [66, 186724], [68, 187284], [71, 187404], [77, 187804], [80, 187944]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 188830, "end": 196917, "text": "Y dijo Adam: Esto es ahora hueso de mis huesos, y carne de mi carne: esta será llamada Mujer, porque del hombre fue tomada.", "words": [[0, 188830], [2, 188998], [7, 189238], [13, 190074], [18, 190358], [21, 190558], [27, 190818], [33, 191298], [36, 191378], [40, 191498], [48, 192078], [50, 192258], [56, 192578], [59, 192758], [62, 192858], [69, 193621], [74, 193884], [79, 194144], [87, 194584], [94, 195244], [101, 195604], [105, 195804], [112, 196044], [116, 196284]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 197197, "end": 205181, "text": "Por tanto, dejará el hombre a su padre y a su madre, y se unirá a su mujer, y serán una sola carne.", "words": [[0, 197197], [4, 197323], [11, 197843], [18, 198643], [21, 198763], [28, 199043], [30, 199203], [33, 199323], [39, 199683], [41, 200023], [43, 200123], [46, 200263], [53, 200583], [55, 201028], [58, 201208], [64, 201908], [66, 202108], [69, 202288], [76, 202728], [78, 203548], [84, 203968], [88, 204168], [93, 204428]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 205531, "end": 210324, "text": "Y estaban ambos desnudos, Adam y su mujer, y no se avergonzaban.", "words": [[0, 20